      "The echo flow returns the input. The chained flow generates a number from 1 to 10, passes it to the double step, and returns the doubled value.": "echo 流返回輸入。鍊式流程產生 1 到 10 之間的數字，將其傳遞給雙步，並傳回加倍後的值。",
      "The echo flow stops after one step. The chained flow routes OnSuccess from the random step to the double step, then returns the double step output.": "迴聲流在一步後停止。鍊式流程將 OnSuccess 從隨機步驟路由到雙步，然後返回雙步輸出。",
      "The echo trigger accepts POST with JSON. The chained trigger accepts GET because the random-number step generates its own starting value.": "echo 觸發器接受帶有 JSON 的 POST。鍊式觸發器接受 GET，因為隨機數步驟會產生自己的起始值。",
