      "The log viewer is only available to administrators.": "日誌檢視器僅供管理員使用。",
      "The second flow demonstrates orchestration: each successful step writes output, and Tempo passes that output as the next step input.": "第二個流程示範了編排：每個成功的步驟都會寫入輸出，Tempo 會將該輸出作為下一步的輸入傳遞。",
