      "This is the inbound URL external clients post to in order to start the associated data flow. The request body becomes the initial StepRequest.Data and the URL is generated from the trigger's id.": "這是外部用戶端發佈到的入站 URL，以便啟動關聯的資料流。請求正文成為初始 StepRequest.Data，並且 URL 是根據觸發器的 id 產生的。",
