      "Tempo created an echo flow and a chained random doubled flow, then ran both through HTTP triggers.": "Tempo 建立了一個回顯流和一個鍊式隨機雙倍流，然後透過 HTTP 觸發器執行這兩個流。",
      "Tempo creates one echo flow and one chained flow that starts with the random-number step and continues into the double-number step.": "Tempo 建立一個迴聲流和一個從隨機數步驟開始並繼續到雙數步驟的連結流。",
      "Tempo creates one echo step plus a random-number step and a double-number step in the same language.": "Tempo 以同一種語言建立一個迴聲步加上一個隨機數步和一個雙數步。",
      "Tempo creates one trigger for the echo flow and one trigger for the random doubled flow.": "Tempo 為迴聲流建立一個觸發器，為隨機加倍流建立一個觸發器。",
      "Tempo packages small source files as artifact-backed steps, connects those steps into flows, creates reusable trigger URLs, then POSTs sample JSON through both flows.": "Tempo 將小型原始檔案打包為工件支援的步驟，將這些步驟連接到流程中，建立可重複使用的觸發器 URL，然後透過兩個流程 POST 範例 JSON。",
      "Tempo runs work as steps connected together in a data flow. This setup creates an echo flow and a second flow that chains a random-number step into a multiply-by-2 step.": "Tempo 運行作為在資料流中連接在一起的步驟進行工作。此設定建立一個迴聲流和第二個流，將隨機數步驟連結到乘以 2 的步驟。",
      "Tempo sends JSON to the echo trigger and calls the chained trigger with GET, then records both executions.": "Tempo 將 JSON 傳送到 echo 觸發器並使用 GET 呼叫鍊式觸發器，然後記錄兩次執行。",
